tit:
Guanli Adhesive Industry - paper instead of plastic coating solutions expert
Established in 2007, Guanli Adhesive has been focusing on new materials in the field of carbon reduction for 18 years, and providing customers with coating solutions based on paper instead of plastic.
At present, Guanli Glue industry is the designated supplier of McDonald's;
Product standard Germany Henkel, the United States Michael men and other international well-known brands;
Is a number of national industry standards drafting units;
Established a special doctoral research station of "Replacing plastic with paper" with HIT.
In the future, Guanli Adhesive industry will continue to promote the deep integration of production, learning, research and use in the field of paper-plastic replacement, and provide customers with more fast and saving paper-plastic replacement coating solutions!
